FleetTelemetryFieldCoverage / FleetTelemetryCoverage.normalize models already exist on this branch
(shared :core compiles green, UP-TO-DATE). The Android DI graph was widened — the documented A7 seam
(DataContainer "the single seam A7 page prompts widen ... register their store") — to expose
